JIRA_TRACK_JIRA_BASE_URL=https://your-company.atlassian.net
JIRA_TRACK_TEMPO_API_TOKEN=your_tempo_api_token_here
# JIRA_TRACK_TEMPO_API_BASE=https://api.tempo.io/4
JIRA_TRACK_TIMEZONE=America/New_York
JIRA_TRACK_DEFAULT_PROJECTS=PROJ,OPS,PLAT
JIRA_TRACK_IN_PROGRESS_STATUSES=In Progress
# JIRA_TRACK_SECONDARY_TRACKING_STATUSES=In Review,In QA
JIRA_TRACK_SESSION_STATE_PATH=.jira-track/session.json
# JIRA_TRACK_DEBUG=true
# JIRA_TRACK_CDP_URL=http://host.docker.internal:9222
# JIRA_TRACK_CDP_ALLOWED_HOSTS=127.0.0.1,localhost,host.docker.internal
# JIRA_TRACK_CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:8080,http://127.0.0.1:8080
# JIRA_TRACK_WEB_FORWARDED_ALLOW_IPS=127.0.0.1

# SSO-only mode: run `jira-track login-sso` to create/update the browser session file above.


Required:

JIRA_TRACK_JIRA_BASE_URL – Base URL of your Jira instance (e.g., https://your-company.atlassian.net)
JIRA_TRACK_TIMEZONE – Timezone for interpreting dates (default: America/New_York)
	Examples:
	- USA (Eastern): America/New_York
	- Argentina: America/Argentina/Buenos_Aires
	- India: Asia/Kolkata
JIRA_TRACK_SESSION_STATE_PATH – Path to the SSO session file (e.g., session.json)
Optional:

JIRA_TRACK_TEMPO_API_TOKEN – API token for Tempo integration (worklogs fallback source)
JIRA_TRACK_TEMPO_API_BASE – Tempo API endpoint (defaults to https://api.tempo.io/4)
JIRA_TRACK_DEFAULT_PROJECTS – Comma-separated list of default Jira project keys to query (e.g., PROJ,OPS,PLAT)
JIRA_TRACK_IN_PROGRESS_STATUSES – Comma-separated list of statuses to consider as "in progress" (e.g., In Progress)
JIRA_TRACK_SECONDARY_TRACKING_STATUSES – Comma-separated list of secondary statuses to track (e.g., In Review,In QA). Tickets found only here default to 0h unless already logged.
JIRA_TRACK_DEBUG – Enable debug logging for Jira requests/responses (true/false, defaults to false)
JIRA_TRACK_CDP_URL – CDP endpoint for reusing host Chrome in SSO login (e.g., http://host.docker.internal:9222)
JIRA_TRACK_CDP_ALLOWED_HOSTS – Comma-separated host allowlist for CDP URL validation (defaults to 127.0.0.1,localhost,host.docker.internal)
JIRA_TRACK_CORS_ORIGINS – Comma-separated allowed CORS origins for web API
JIRA_TRACK_WEB_FORWARDED_ALLOW_IPS – Comma-separated proxy IPs trusted for forwarded headers (defaults to 127.0.0.1)
